# docs_lookup

Before answering conceptual questions about this project, check `/docs` instead of guessing from code.

The full procedure (which docs to read for which question, how to navigate the doc map, what to do when topic isn't documented) is in [.claude/skills/docs_lookup/SKILL.md](mdc:.claude/skills/docs_lookup/SKILL.md).

Read that file when this rule triggers, then follow it.

**Quick reference:** documentation map

```
docs/
├── vision/         pitch, pillars (the 5 non-negotiable principles)
├── design/         systems/ (exploration, social, trade, combat, character-creation, leveling), ux/
├── narrative/      world, npcs, quests, dm-style
├── tech/           architecture, llm-integration, data-models, adr/
└── production/     roadmap, backlog
```
